    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n35898" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">phălangĭum</span></b>  or <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">-on</span></b> , ii, n.
		(late collat. form <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">phălangĭus</span></b> , ii,
		m., <i><span class="en">Veg. Vet. 3, 81</span></i>;
				<i><span class="en">Isid. 14, 6, 16</span></i>), = <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φαλάγγιον</span>. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>A kind of venomous spider</i>, <i><span class="en">Cels. 5,
				27, 9</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Plin. 18, 17, 44, § 156</span></i>;
				<i><span class="en">8, 27, 41, §
			97</span></i>; <i><span class="en">11, 24, 28,
				§ 79</span></i>. —</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>Spider-root</i>, <i>anthericum</i>,
			for phalangites, <i><span class="en">Plin. 27, 12, 98, §
		124</span></i>.</div>
